    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being a protector of humanity is cool, but let\u2019s be honest - the real fight begins inside\u2026 of You. For example when your body is fighting microbes and nasty bacterias. Have you ever wondered what it looks like in real life?<br><br>Now's your chance to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c3dc2389d40001f393a344014de0d5d7.avif?t=1749755072\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bacterian is an arcade game in which you become a red blood cell and protect your organism from all sorts of dangers that flood your microbiome. Instead of fighting them in open conflict, you must use your intelligence to reach them first in a classic, Sokoban-style way. But remember\u2026 Every second counts and the clock is ticking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat more and more advanced levels and face increasing numbers of various enemies, after all you are the first and last hope for recovery. No antibiotics allowed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/67f973c2abaec8f7247680fd007d2564.avif?t=1749755072\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game key features\u00a0\u2935\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6\ufe0f 100 varied levels increasing difficulty diverse enemies <br>\u25b6\ufe0f Cute and cool retro visuals &amp; music<br>\u25b6\ufe0f Level editor for creative players<br>\u25b6\ufe0f Steam achievements &amp; controller support<br>\u25b6\ufe0f Perfect game when fighting with real flu! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take care of yourself, stay healthy and play Bacterian!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/28bf03963aea226957966b617cc42a7e.avif?t=1749755072\" width=96 height=96 /></span></p>",
